  "description": "<p>A secure, local REST API solution for FoundryVTT v13 with enhanced security, permission validation, and Query System support. Works with a companion bridge server to provide HTTP endpoints for external integrations.</p><p><strong>v2.0 Features:</strong></p><ul><li>FoundryVTT v13 Query System for reliable RPC</li><li>Complete permission validation system</li><li>Input sanitization and injection prevention</li><li>Per-user API key support</li><li>Permission-based data filtering</li><li>Enhanced security test coverage</li></ul><p><strong>Architecture:</strong> FoundryVTT Module + Node.js Bridge Server</p><p><strong>Security:</strong> Role-based access control, document-level permissions, comprehensive input validation</p><p><strong>Requires:</strong> FoundryVTT v13+, Companion bridge server (included)</p>",
